**Not decorated as a `/tool`**, same reason as authorization_code — plus this grant is dropped outright in OAuth 2.1 and most providers are phasing it out (the token comes back directly in the redirect URL fragment, with no client secret involved at all — a real security weakness). Included only because the skill documents it and some older provider integrations still require it.

